            <ArticleTitle>c.464A&gt;G variation in the GJB2 gene is detected in a Han Chinese family.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1785-1788</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/ccr3.1184</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report two heterozygous carriers of c.464A&gt;G variation in the GJB2 gene in a Chinese pedigree. The proband with hearing loss most likely inherited the c.464A&gt;G variation from his mother who also carries heterozygous c.79G&gt;A variation and has normal hearing. The pathological significance of c.464A&gt;G variation remains to be determined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
